{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-09-25 22:30:00', 'title': 'WESTERN POTASH CORP EXECUTES BINDING OFFTAKE AGREEMENT WITH ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND COMPANY', 'text': 'WESTERN RESOURCES CORP. ANNOUNCED THAT WESTERN POTASH CORP. ENTERED INTO A BINDING OFFTAKE AGREEMENT WITH ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND COMPANY FOR 100% OF THE POTASH PRODUCTION (146,000 TONNES PER ANNUM) FROM THE MILESTONE PHASE I PLANT. KEY TERMS OF THE OFFTAKE AGREEMENT INCLUDE: BINDING COMMITMENT TO TAKE 100% OF THE PRODUCED POTASH FROM THE PHASE I PROJECT; FREE-ON-BOARD (FOB) MINE SITE AND TRANSPORTED FROM THE SITE BY TRUCK TO THE NEARBY PORT LAJORD TERMINAL, ONLY 13 KILOMETERS FROM THE PROJECT SITE; A STRUCTURE TO INCENTIVIZE THE BEST FINAL SALE PRICE FOR BOTH PARTIES.'}{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-09-25 13:30:00', 'title': 'ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND, LG CHEM ANNOUNCE JV TO CREATE BIOBASED ACRYLIC ACID', 'text': 'ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND CO - CO, LG CHEM TODAY ANNOUNCED A JOINT DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT TO CREATE BIOBASED ACRYLIC ACID.ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND - CO, LG CHEM WILL WORK TOWARDS ECONOMICALLY VIABLE COMMERCIAL PRODUCTION OF 100% BIOBASED ACRYLIC ACID.ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND CO - LG CHEM TO REVIEW CONSTRUCTION OF A BIO-SAP PRODUCTION PLANT IN NORTH AMERICA.ARCHER DANIELS MIDLAND CO -  TO SUPPORT PRODUCTION, LG CHEM PLANS TO EXPLORE ADDITIONAL BIO PLASTIC BUSINESS OPPORTUNITIES.'}